<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,944.46 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,944.46 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange closed officially at 5,944.46 points, down 26.44, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 6.128 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures settlement prices weakened for all maturities, by between 10 and 199.50 points. June BUX settled at 6,254.50 points, down 22.50.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
